<title>USA: Atalanta/Sosnoff Capital names president.</title>
<headline>Atalanta/Sosnoff Capital names president.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Atalanta/Sosnoff Capital Corp said on Monday that it had appointed Craig Steinberg as president and a director of the company.</p>
<p>In addition, Atalanta named Anthony Miller as its new executive vice president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>In a press statement, Atalanta said the company's former president and chief operating officer, Robert Kobel, &quot;was terminated without cause pursuant to the terms of his employment agreement.&quot;</p>
